# TwinCAT 3 / Visual Studio (XAE) — ignore everything that is *regenerated*
# from the .sln/.tsproj sources. Keep the editable project; drop the build junk.
#
# KEEP (do NOT ignore): *.sln, *.tsproj, *.xti, *.tmc, *.plcproj and PLC source,
# *.xml ESI overrides. These are the source of truth for the rig config.

# --- Activated runtime / boot config (rewritten by every "Activate Configuration") ---
_Boot/
_Config/_Boot/
**/_Boot/

# --- Compiler intermediates ---
_CompileInfo/
**/_CompileInfo/
_ModuleInstall/
_UpgradedProjFiles/

# --- Lock file written while the solution is open in the IDE ---
*.tslock

# --- IDE auto-backup of the project (rewritten on every Save All) ---
*.bak

# --- Generated symbol / compiled-library outputs ---
*.tpy
*.compiled-library
*.tczip
*.tszip
*.tmc~

# --- Visual Studio / XAE Shell user state ---
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.sou
Backup*/
_sav/

# --- Misc local build output ---
Bin/
_Bin/
